<title>USA: Steel of West Virginia chairman retires.</title>
<headline>Steel of West Virginia chairman retires.</headline>
<dateline>HUNTINGTON, W.Va. 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Steel of West Virginia Inc said Monday chairman and chief executive officer Robert Bunting retired on Friday, July 11.</p>
<p>Albert Eastburn, former president of the steel group of Lukens Inc, has been named chairman and Steel of West Virginia president Timothy Duke is named to the additional post of chief executive officer, it said.</p>
